			"notes": "# 2.0.0\n\n## Hyperspace\n- Spatial Distortions now form across the world, and they're how you reach Hyperspace. The star rating comes from the distortion.\n- Added Distortion Splicers for early access, and a new way to get Hoopa.\n- Reworked donuts: cook a plain donut, then surround it with up to 8 berries in the Campfire Pot. Flavours now come from Cobblemon's own berry values.\n- Added Flavor Powers: Humungo, Teensy, Item, Big Haul, Encounter and Catching, alongside Sparkling and Alpha.\n- Removed the Hoopa Ring and Legendary Essence. Legendaries and Megas now appear at a flat chance on 5 star and 4 star distortions.\n- Spatial Distortions show up on Xaero's Minimap and World Map.\n\n## Wormholes\n- Added new Ultra Space locations, including Ultra Jungle, Ultra Crater and the Wilds areas.\n- Added world music, new blocks and Ultra Beast spawns.\n- Removed Ultra Hide, the Flutes, Ultra Ruins and Ultra Valley.\n\n## General\n- Added Hyperspace and Wormholes advancement tabs.\n- Merged the keybinds into one section: Target Pokeball/Pokemon and Open Wormhole.\n- Now requires AllTheMons x Mega Showdown and Cobblemon 1.8.4."
		},
